<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>wedlock forgot password</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        @font-face {
            font-family: "Proxima Nova regular";
            src: url('../public/font/Proxima-Nova-Regular.otf') format("opentype");
            font-family: "Proxima Nova thin";
            src: url('../public/font/Proxima-Nova-Thin.otf') format("opentype");
        }

        body {
            font-family: "Proxima Nova regular", sans-serif;
            background-color: #F4F4F4;
        }

        p {
            font-family: Proxima Nova thin, sans-serif;
            color: #4D4D4D;
        }

    

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .main {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 800px;
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        #title {
            margin-top: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 21.92px;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #4D4D4D;
        }

        #name {
            color: black;
        }

        .content h3 {
            margin: 1rem 0 2rem;
            color: #007EAF;
            font-size: 40px;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 48.72px;
        }

        .content p {
            margin: 2rem 0;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 24px;
        }

        .otp {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .otp div {
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #007EAF;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border: 2px solid #53ADAE;
            border-radius: 10px;
            min-width: 60px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        #char{
            margin-right: 20px;
        }

        #thakyou {
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .footer {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        a {
            color: #4D4D4D;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
        }

        @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .container {
                padding: 10px;
            }

            .main {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }

            .content h3 {
                font-size: 32px;
                line-height: 38px;
            }

            .otp div {
                font-size: 32px;
                padding: 8px 16px;
                min-width: 50px;
            }
            

            .content p {
                font-size: 14px;
                line-height: 22px;
            }

            #title {
                font-size: 16px;
            }
        }

        @media screen and (max-width: 400px) {
            .otp div {
                font-size: 28px;
                padding: 6px 12px;
                min-width: 40px;
            }
            #char{
            margin-right: 10px;
        }

            .content h3 {
                font-size: 28px;
                line-height: 34px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="main">
            <a href="https://www.wedlock.au">
                <img src="https://wedlock.au/wedlock-img.jpg" alt="Wedlock Logo" style="width: 300px; height: 100px;">
            </a>
            <div class="content">
                <h2 id="title">Hello <span id="name"><%= name %></span></h2>
                <h3>Forgot Password?</h3>
                <p>It happens to the best of us! If you've forgotten your password for Wedlock, no worries. We're here to help you reset it.</p>
                <p>To reset your password, please use the following recovery code:</p>
                <div class="otp">
                    <% activationCode.split('').forEach((char) => { %>
                        <div id="char"><%= char %></div>
                    <% }) %>
                </div>
                <p>In case you have not initiated this request, call us at 13009335625 or <a href="https://wedlock.au/contact-us">write to
                        us</a>.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer">
                <p>The Wedlock Team</p>
                <p><a href="https://www.wedlock.com.au">https://www.wedlock.au</a></p>
                <p>Copyright © 2025 Wedlock</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>